  \n                 \n              \n                \n                 \n                  Services we provide\n                    \n                 \n              \n                \n             \n\n            \n             \n              \n                \n                 \n\n                  \n                     \n                       Accelerate AI Securely \n                      \n                         Enable secure AI adoption with visibility, governance, and control across identities, agents, and access \n                      \n                     \n                  \n                     \n                       Defend Against AI Attacks \n                      \n                         Protect your organization from AI-driven threats by securing identities, controlling access, and reducing attack paths. \n                      \n                     \n                  \n                     \n                       Cyber Insurance \n                      \n                         Improve your cyber insurance readiness with stronger identity security, governance, and privileged access controls. \n                      \n                     \n                  \n                     \n                       Ransomware \n                      \n                         Defend against ransomware by securing privileged identities, limiting access, and reducing attack paths. \n                      \n                     \n                  \n                     \n                       Vendor Consolidation \n                      \n                         Reduce complexity, strengthen security and improve IT ROI through platform consolidation. \n                      \n                     \n                  \n                     \n                       Secure Remote Workforce \n                      \n                         Secure access for employees, contractors, and third parties from anywhere. \n                      \n    