account  \n       \n   \n \n   \n     \n   \n\n     \n     \n       \n             \n               \n       \n               \n     \n   \n  \n  \n   \n     \n                Security advisories    \n\n      \n                       Commerce Core - Highly critical - Access bypass - SA-CONTRIB-2026-254 \n                     \n\n    \n           \n       \n        \n         \n                                            \n     \n \n    \n   \n     \n\n  \n      \n  \n   \n      Project:     Commerce Core      Project machine name:     commerce      Date:    2026-October-28     Security risk:      Highly critical  21 ∕ 25 AC:None/A:None/CI:Some/II:Some/E:Exploit/TD:All      Vulnerability:    Access bypass     Affected versions:    <2.41 || >=3.0.0 <3.3.13     CVE IDs:    CVE-2026-118539     Description:     This module enables you to sell goods and services to customers through an included shopping cart and checkout form or through decoupled applications via APIs. \n The module doesn't sufficiently protect certain routes and entity fields, leading to an access bypass that may financially impact the vendor.  \n This vulnerability is being actively exploited in the wild.      Solution:     Install the latest version: \n \n If you use version 3.x, upgrade to  Commerce Core 3.3.13 . \n If you use an earlier version, upgrade to  Commerce Core 8.x-2.41 . \n \n  Sites should audit their orders for inconsistencies as this vulnerability is being actively exploited.       Reported By:     \n  Dan Puccetti (dpuccetti) \n   Marcus Johansson (marcus_johansson) \n   Robert Snyder (rsnyd) \n       Fixed By:     \n  Jonathan Sacksick (jsacksick) \n   Lee Rowlands (larowlan)  of the Drupal Security Team\n   Mohit Aghera (mohit_aghera)  provisional member of the Drupal Security Team\n   Ryan Szrama (rszrama) \n   Tom Ashe (tomtech) \n   Jakub Piasecki (zaporylie) \n       Coordinated By:     \n  Swan Kalata (akalata)  of the Drupal Security Team\n   Bram Driesen (bramdriesen)  of the Drupal Security Team\n   Damien McKenna (damienmckenna)  of the Drupal Security Team\n   Greg Knaddison (greggles)  of the Drupal Security Team\n   Juraj Nemec (poker10)  of the Drupal Security Team\n   Vijay Mani (vijaycs85)  provisional member of the Drupal Security Team\n   Jess  (xjm)  of the Drupal Security Team\n        Contribution record     \n\n    \n\n \n\n   \n   \n \n   \n \n                               \n\n         \n\n               \n           \n               \n     \n \n     Contact and more information \n  \n   \n     The Drupal security team can be reached by email at security at drupal.org or  via the contact form . \n Learn more about  the Drupal Security team and their policies ,  writing secure code for Drupal , and  securing your site . \n Follow the Drupal Security Team on  Bluesky , or  Mastodon  or  Linkedin .    \n   \n \n \n \n     Contributing organizations for this advisory \n  \n   \n       Centarro    Colorado Governor's Office of Information Technology - Colorado Digital Service    ActivIT s.r.o.    Zoocha    xjm    PreviousNext    Sopra Steria    Jakub Piasecki Consulting    HeroDevs    Reading Room    Acro Commerce    Solathat    FreelyGive    Tag1 Consulting, Inc.    The security team is made up of volunteers around the world. The companies above have sponsored time on this release.    \n   \n \n   \n             \n           \n      \n                \n\n   \n             \n     \n \n    \n   \n     Infrastructure management for Drupal.org provided by      \n   \n \n \n \n    \n   \n     News items    News  \n  Planet Drupal  \n  Social media  \n  Sign up for Drupal news  \n  Security advisories  \n  Our community    Community  \n   Services ,  Training  &  Hosting   \n  Contributor guide  \n  Groups & meetups  \n  DrupalCon  \n  Code of conduct  \n  Documentation    Documentation  \n  Drupal Guide  \n  Drupal User Guide  \n  Developer docs  \n  API.Drupal.org  \n  Drupal code base    Download & Extend  \n  Drupal core  \n  Modules  \n  Themes  \n  Distributions  \n  Governance of community    About  \n  Web accessibility  \n  Drupal Association  \n  About Drupal.org  \n  Terms of service  \n  Privacy policy  \n    \n   \n \n \n \n    \n   \n     Drupal is a  registered trademark  of  Dries Buytaert . \n   \n   \n \n   \n       \n   \n\n \n \n \n\n \n \n \n\n  \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n"
