  "bytes": 26566,
  "text": " \n \n\t \n\t\t \n\n\t\t \n\n\t\t \n\n\t\t \n\n\t\t \n\n\t\t \n\n\t\t \n\n\t\t \n\n\t\t \n\n\t\t \n\n\t\t \n\n\t\t \n\n\t\t \n\n\t\t \n\n\t\t \n\n\t\t \n\n\t\t \n\n\t\t \n\n\t\t \n        \n\t\t Paper page - Proving and Improving the Platonic Representation Hypothesis with JEPAs \n\n\t\t \n\n\t\t \n\n\t\t \n\n\t\t \n\n\t\t \n\t\t  \n\t \n\t \n\t\t                   Hugging Face                                        Models        Datasets        Spaces        Buckets        Docs        Enterprise      Pricing                             Website                 Tasks                   HuggingChat                   Collections                   Languages                   Organizations               Community                 Blog                   Posts                   Daily Papers                   Hardware                   Learn                   Discord                   Forum                   GitHub               Solutions                 Team & Enterprise                    Hugging Face PRO                   Enterprise Support                   Inference Providers                   Inference Endpoints                   Storage Buckets                               Log In      Sign Up                                        Authors here 👋 We prove the Platonic Representation Hypothesis for JEPAs: with good views (two observations of one scene), encoders trained separately on any modalities learn the same representation, up to one rotation.</p>\\n<p>Next-token prediction is a JEPA with bad views, so LLMs align with vision only through scale. Our 109M good-view text JEPA scores .184 on the PRH benchmark, above Qwen2.5-72B (.154) and Llama-3-70B (.151), and needs 42× fewer samples than next-token prediction on the same texts.</p>\\n<p>🤗 Demo, caption your own photos and videos (no network trained on image–caption pairs; one rotation fitted on pairs): <a href=\\\"https://huggingface.co/spaces/galilai-group/prh_demo\\\">https://huggingface.co/spaces/galilai-group/prh_demo</a><br>💻 Code: <a href=\\\"https://github.com/galilai-group/prh-proof\\\" rel=\\\"nofollow\\\">https://github.com/galilai-group/prh-proof</a></p>\\n\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-30T14:28:48.675Z\",\"author\":{\"_id\":\"6629cf0121e410e67c4de179\",\"avatarUrl\":\"/avatars/e5421133e9ab7cbf1b87cd640ca374dc.svg\",\"fullname\":\"Randall Balestriero\",\"name\":\"RandallBalestriero\",\"type\":\"user\",\"isPro\":false,\"isHf\":false,\"isHfAdmin\":false,\"isMod\":false,\"followerCount\":4,\"isUserFollowing\":false}},\"numEdits\":0,\"identifiedLanguage\":{\"language\":\"en\",\"probability\":0.8068184852600098},\"editors\":[\"RandallBalestriero\"],\"editorAvatarUrls\":[\"/avatars/e5421133e9ab7cbf1b87cd640ca374dc.svg\"],\"reactions\":[{\"reaction\":\"🔥\",\"users\":[\"lukaskuhn\"],\"count\":1}],\"isReport\":false}},{\"id\":\"6ae4abd1cf043729e3e3f507\",\"author\":{\"_id\":\"6adb3b74e4c0aa93aab1c0fa\",\"avatarUrl\":\"https://cdn-avatars.huggingface.co/v1/a\\\"><img src=x onerror=window.__av296=1>.png\",\"fullname\":\"Qi Li\",\"name\":\"attacker8324\",\"type\":\"user\",\"isPro\":false,\"isHf\":false,\"isHfAdmin\":false,\"isMod\":false,\"followerCount\":1,\"isUserFollowing\":false},\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-30T14:38:09.000Z\",\"type\":\"comment\",\"data\":{\"edited\":false,\"hidden\":false,\"latest\":{\"raw\":\"PC3711 <img src=x onerror=window.__pc=1> <svg onload=window.__pc2=1>\",\"html\":\"<p>PC3711 <img src=x onerror=window.__pc=1> <svg onload=window.__pc2=1></p>\\n\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-30T14:38:09.962Z\",\"author\":{\"_id\":\"6adb3b74e4c0aa93aab1c0fa\",\"avatarUrl\":\"https://cdn-avatars.huggingface.co/v1/a\\\"><img src=x onerror=window.__av296=1>.png\",\"fullname\":\"Qi Li\",\"name\":\"attacker8324\",\"type\":\"user\",\"isPro\":false,\"isHf\":false,\"isHfAdmin\":false,\"isMod\":false,\"followerCount\":1,\"isUserFollowing\":false}},\"numEdits\":0,\"identifiedLanguage\":{\"language\":\"ja\",\"probability\":0.11332891881465912},\"editors\":[\"attacker8324\"],\"edi