        \n             \n             Verified\n                \n             \n           Learn about vigilant mode .\n         \n       \n     \n \n\n         \n\n \n   \n           0.9.0  (2026-09-12) \n ⚠ BREAKING CHANGES \n \n the response envelope moves to 2.4. Stateful ref actions can now return ACTION_FAILED for an observed postcondition contradiction, and ActionResult::from_execution takes only action and steps. \n \n Features \n \n verify stateful ref actions against fresh platform state ( 9bc91bc ) \n \n Bug Fixes \n \n guard the debug viewer image sink and unpin a flaky test deadline ( fca24f2 ) \n report unread expand state as unverified rather than failed ( a7131c2 ) \n  \n \n   \n         \n           \n     \n            \n       Assets \n       10 \n     \n \n              \n  \n         \n        Loading \n \n\n   \n     \n   \n     \n      \n\n               Uh oh!\n \n                There was an error while loading.  Please reload this page . \n \n\n    \n    \n  \n  \n\n         \n\n\n           \n               \n      -->     \n     \n     \n       \n         \n              \n     All reactions \n   \n \n\n           \n           \n         \n       \n     \n       \n \n           \n \n  \n     \n   \n\n       \n     \n\n     \n    Previous   1   2   3   4   5   Next  \n \n\n \n    Previous   Next  \n \n\n \n\n \n\n\n   \n\n \n\n\n     \n   \n\n   \n\n           \n   Footer \n\n  \n\n\n   \n     \n       \n         \n \n       \n        &copy; 2026 GitHub, Inc.\n       \n     \n\n     \n       Footer navigation \n\n       \n\n\n           \n             Terms \n           \n\n           \n             Privacy \n           \n\n\n             \n               Security \n             \n\n             \n               Status \n             \n\n           \n             Community \n           \n\n           \n             Docs \n           \n\n           \n             Contact \n           \n\n          \n \n   \n     \n      Manage cookies\n   